'minerals'

20                             ;number of minerals

'calcite'                      ;erw_comm: reported to be present in the amendment in supplementary material in Beerling et al. (2024)

'actinolite-crit'              ;erw_comm: reported to be present in the amendment in supplementary material in Beerling et al. (2024)

'epidote-marieni'              ;erw_comm: reported to be present in the amendment in supplementary material in Beerling et al. (2024)

